; Valid $INCLUDE fixture: karicheck must accept it (run_sanitizer_smoke_test.sh "$INCLUDE valid").
; RFC 1035 §5.1: "$INCLUDE <file-name> [<domain-name>]"; the optional origin applies to the included
; file only, and the origin of the including file is restored afterwards.
$ORIGIN example.com.
$TTL 3600
@ IN SOA ns1.example.com. hostmaster.example.com. 1 7200 3600 1209600 3600
@ IN NS ns1.example.com.
ns1 IN A 192.0.2.1
$INCLUDE valid_child.inc
$INCLUDE valid_sub.inc sub.example.com.
after IN A 192.0.2.4
